    "text": "The total charge on the system of capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#956;F</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;F</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;F</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;F</mi></math> connected in parallel is<br />(Assume a battery of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> is connected to the combination)",
